#: packages/api/src/presenters/reference-comparison.ts
msgid "Shows whether your usual resting heart rate (the median of the last 28 days) is below, within or above the middle half of US adults of your age group and sex, measured from 1999 to 2008 (NCHS). Needs your birth year and sex for reference tables in your profile, each with its consent. Device readings are usually taken differently from the seated pulse in the reference, so treat them as a rough guide."
